ETHICAL COMMITMENT:

While this software is licensed under the permissive MIT License, we ask that
any use, modification, or distribution of this software maintain the core
ethical principles outlined in docs/ETHICS_FRAMEWORK.md:

1. User Autonomy Always Primary
2. Human Connection Over AI
3. Data Minimization & POPIA Compliance
4. Full Transparency
5. Real-World Outcomes Over Engagement
6. Cultural Humility
7. Anti-Platform Dependency
8. Vulnerability Protection

This software is designed to help vulnerable populations. Please use it
responsibly and ethically.
